   "title": {
    "zh": "两行字母",
    "en": "Two Rows of Letters"
   },
   "why": {
    "zh": "五个模块落在一块芯片上，十个坐标化成两行字母。为什么搜坐标很难；两块之间的规则；十对关系、两张约束图；E 取 3、5、7 中的最大值 7，D 被 B 顶到 3；为什么取最大；一个合法却装不下的序列对；不变的量与会变的量；在序列对上搜索；同一布局的不同写法。",
    "en": "Five blocks land on a die and their ten coordinates turn into two rows of letters. Why searching coordinates is hard; the rule for two blocks; ten pairs and two constraint graphs; E takes the largest of 3, 5, 7, and B pushes D up to 3; why the maximum; a valid pair that does not fit; what never changes and what does; searching over pairs; and different encodings of one packing."
   },
