      {
       "start": 0.0,
       "end": 4.4,
       "text": "一块芯片上，要摆五个模块。",
       "sceneId": "p-die"
      },
      {
       "start": 4.4,
       "end": 9.4,
       "text": "每块写下左下角：十个数。",
       "sceneId": "p-die"
      },
      {
       "start": 11.95,
       "end": 16.55,
       "text": "其实，两行字母就够了。",
       "sceneId": "p-words"
      },
      {
       "start": 17.41,
       "end": 22.21,
       "text": "随便改一个坐标，块就可能压在一起。",
       "sceneId": "p-why"
      },
      {
       "start": 22.21,
       "end": 27.01,
       "text": "改两行字母，永远不会重叠。",
       "sceneId": "p-why"
      },
      {
       "start": 27.01,
       "end": 30.61,
       "text": "这就是序列对。",
       "sceneId": "p-why"
      },
      {
       "start": 37.0,
       "end": 41.6,
       "text": "任取两块，看它们在两行里的先后。",
       "sceneId": "p-rule"
      },
      {
       "start": 41.6,
       "end": 45.8,
       "text": "次序相同：在前的在左边。",
       "sceneId": "p-rule"
      },
      {
       "start": 45.8,
       "end": 50.4,
       "text": "次序相反：pos 里在前的在下面。",
       "sceneId": "p-rule"
      },
      {
       "start": 51.18,
       "end": 55.78,
       "text": "五块，十对，每对恰好一种关系。",
       "sceneId": "p-pairs"
      },
      {
       "start": 55.78,
       "end": 59.98,
       "text": "六对左右，四对上下。",
       "sceneId": "p-pairs"
      },
      {
       "start": 63.15,
       "end": 67.35,
       "text": "左右连成 H，上下连成 V。",
       "sceneId": "p-graphs"
      },
      {
       "start": 67.35,
       "end": 72.35,
       "text": "每条边：后面的块要让开前面的块。",
       "sceneId": "p-graphs"
      },
      {
       "start": 72.35,
       "end": 76.75,
       "text": "箭头都顺着 pos，不会绕成圈。",
       "sceneId": "p-graphs"
      },
      {
       "start": 80.16,
       "end": 85.56,
       "text": "E 要让开 A、B、C：候选 3、5、7。",
       "sceneId": "p-dp"
      },
      {
       "start": 85.56,
       "end": 88.96,
       "text": "取最大：x = 7。",
       "sceneId": "p-dp"
      },
      {
       "start": 89.1,
       "end": 93.7,
       "text": "D 要让开四块：最高的 B 把它顶到 3。",
       "sceneId": "p-pack"
      },
      {
       "start": 93.7,
       "end": 96.7,
       "text": "9 × 4，装进边界。",
       "sceneId": "p-pack"
      },
      {
       "start": 102.5,
       "end": 106.9,
       "text": "三块：B 要同时让开 A 和 C。",
       "sceneId": "p-max"
      },
      {
       "start": 106.9,
       "end": 110.9,
       "text": "取最小 2，B 压在 A 上。",
       "sceneId": "p-max"
      },
      {
       "start": 110.9,
       "end": 114.9,
       "text": "取最大 3，两条都满足。",
       "sceneId": "p-max"
      },
      {
       "start": 119.27,
       "end": 123.181,
       "text": "两行一模一样：五块排成一行。",
       "sceneId": "p-overflow"
      },
      {
       "start": 123.181,
       "end": 126.648,
       "text": "宽 12，装不下 10 × 8。",
       "sceneId": "p-overflow"
      },
      {
       "start": 126.648,
       "end": 130.337,
       "text": "反过来，高 10，也装不下。",
       "sceneId": "p-overflow"
      },
      {
       "start": 130.337,
       "end": 133.337,
       "text": "合法只保证不重叠。",
       "sceneId": "p-overflow"
      },
      {
       "start": 134.16,
       "end": 139.16,
       "text": "布图工具就在这些写法之间搜索。",
