    "zh": "进阶：七个为什么",
    "en": "The whys: seven questions"
   },
   "why": {
    "zh": "为什么最长路径就是最紧凑的坐标、为什么取最大、为什么约束图没有环、为什么不重叠却装不下（14,400 中 720）、为什么多个序列对给出同一布局（9,056 种）、另一种约定怎样换算，以及代价与搜索。",
    "en": "Why the longest path is the most compact coordinate, why the maximum, why the graphs have no cycle, why overlap-free pairs can overflow (720 of 14,400), why several pairs share one packing (9,056 packings), how to convert the other convention, and cost and search."
   },
